{"type":"text","timestamp":1794348712514,"sessionID":"ses_e3881931cffeUV0aIWtfc95zIA","part":{"id":"prt_1c784822f001MX3s0xLh721Ikk","messageID":"msg_1c784768e00112Cdc5qIKkMSXy","sessionID":"ses_e3881931cffeUV0aIWtfc95zIA","type":"text","text":"<think>Wait, I need the *first* read-all to return 3 (three unread notifications at that point: \"hello world\" + \"second\" + \"third\"). Let me restructure:\n\n```\nREADALL=$(curl -s -X POST \"$BASE/notifications/read-all\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ALICE\")\ncheck \"read-all status\" \"200\" \"$(status ...)\"\ncheck \"read-all updated\" \"3\" \"$(echo \"$READALL\" | jqf \"d['updated']\")\"\ncheck \"read-all idempotent\" \"0\" \"$(curl -s -X POST ... | jqf \"d['updated']\")\"\n```\n\nLetme rewrite that block properly.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794348712495,"end":1794348712510}}}
